  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Existe un Pokémon con cuerpo de plasma, capaz\nde introducirse en diversos electrodomésticos.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Por supuesto, hablamos de Rotom!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10050006F007200200073007500700075006500730074006F002C0020006800610062006C0061006D006F007300200064006500200052006F0074006F006D002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Veo que tú también tienes un SmartRotom.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00560065006F00200071007500650020007400FA002000740061006D0062006900E9006E0020007400690065006E0065007300200075006E00200053006D0061007200740052006F0074006F006D002E00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Es un artículo preciado, puesto que su valor\ndepende del número de especímenes de Rotom<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nen la actualidad.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 113
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Los SmartRotom no son moco de pavo, pero\nel verdadero cometido de los Rotom es entrar<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nen electrodomésticos.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 115
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué me dices de un combate contra Rotom en\nsus diversas formas?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0051007500E90020006D006500200064006900630065007300200064006500200075006E00200063006F006D006200610074006500200063006F006E00740072006100200052006F0074006F006D00200065006E000A00730075007300200064006900760065007200730061007300200066006F0072006D00610073003F00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Avísame si te apetece!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10041007600ED00730061006D006500200073006900200074006500200061007000650074006500630065002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Me pregunto en qué electrodomésticos se\nintroducirá!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004D0065002000700072006500670075006E0074006F00200065006E00200071007500E900200065006C0065006300740072006F0064006F006D00E90073007400690063006F0073002000730065000A0069006E00740072006F0064007500630069007200E1002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Quieres combatir contra Rotom en sus distintas\nformas?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF005100750069006500720065007300200063006F006D0062006100740069007200200063006F006E00740072006100200052006F0074006F006D00200065006E0020007300750073002000640069007300740069006E007400610073000A0066006F0072006D00610073003F00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Sí!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005300ED00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Todavía no",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006F00640061007600ED00610020006E006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Venga, no te hagas de rogar.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00560065006E00670061002C0020006E006F00200074006500200068006100670061007300200064006500200072006F006700610072002E00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Señoras y señores, he aquí Rotom! ¡Observad\ncómo se mete en todo tipo de electrodomésticos!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n¡Ahí va el primero!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 120
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Qué nervios!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10051007500E90020006E0065007200760069006F0073002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Cuando toma posesión de un horno eléctrico,\nse convierte en Rotom Calor!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Es de tipo Eléctrico y Fuego! ¡Y fíjate, ya no es de\ntipo Fantasma!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004500730020006400650020007400690070006F00200045006C00E900630074007200690063006F0020007900200046007500650067006F0021002000A100590020006600ED006A006100740065002C0020007900610020006E006F002000650073002000640065000A007400690070006F002000460061006E007400610073006D0061002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Además, conoce el movimiento Sofoco!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004100640065006D00E10073002C00200063006F006E006F0063006500200065006C0020006D006F00760069006D00690065006E0074006F00200053006F0066006F0063006F002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si está de buen humor, hornea que no veas.\nPero, como se le crucen los cables, ¡te carboniza!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Prepárate para conocer el poder de Rotom!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005000720065007000E100720061007400650020007000610072006100200063006F006E006F00630065007200200065006C00200070006F00640065007200200064006500200052006F0074006F006D002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué te ha parecido mi Rotom Calor? Te vas a ir\na casa calentit<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡El siguiente es Rotom Lavado! Está metido en\nuna lavadora, por si no quedaba claro.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Absolutamente brillante!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004100620073006F006C007500740061006D0065006E007400650020006200720069006C006C0061006E00740065002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0019>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00190000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Rotom Lavado es de tipo Eléctrico y Agua!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10052006F0074006F006D0020004C0061007600610064006F0020006500730020006400650020007400690070006F00200045006C00E900630074007200690063006F0020007900200041006700750061002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Su ataque Hidrobomba es la bomba!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100530075002000610074006100710075006500200048006900640072006F0062006F006D006200610020006500730020006C006100200062006F006D00620061002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Si hasta tiene una función para cancelar el\nlavado si se te olvida el detergente! ¡Es tan útil!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Pero cuidado, que también te puede inundar\nla casa!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005000650072006F0020006300750069006400610064006F002C0020007100750065002000740061006D0062006900E9006E00200074006500200070007500650064006500200069006E0075006E006400610072000A006C006100200063006100730061002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué me dices de mi Rotom Lavado? Espero que\nno te haya hecho pasar un mal trago.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y ahora es el momento de tomar posesión de\nun cortacésped con... ¡Rotom Corte!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Una elección tajante!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10055006E006100200065006C006500630063006900F3006E002000740061006A0061006E00740065002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\"",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00220000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Rotom Corte es de tipo Eléctrico y Planta!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10052006F0074006F006D00200043006F0072007400650020006500730020006400650020007400690070006F00200045006C00E900630074007200690063006F0020007900200050006C0061006E00740061002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Conoce el movimiento Lluevehojas!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10043006F006E006F0063006500200065006C0020006D006F00760069006D00690065006E0074006F0020004C006C00750065007600650068006F006A00610073002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El problema es tener un jardín lo bastante grande\ncomo para poder usarlo, pero eso ya es harina de<U+0010><U+0001>븀\notro costal.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 119
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Además se pone chulo y te desparrama toda\nla hierba recién cortada por ahí!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿'",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 4824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué te ha parecido mi Rotom? Espero no\nhaberte cortado el rollo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 4836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0051007500E900200074006500200068006100200070006100720065006300690064006F0020006D006900200052006F0074006F006D003F002000450073007000650072006F0020006E006F000A006800610062006500720074006500200063006F0072007400610064006F00200065006C00200072006F006C006C006F002E00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ahora es el turno de ver a Rotom Ventilador, que\nes cuando Rotom se mete en... ¡Bueno, es obvio!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 4976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Si es que las pillas al vuelo!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10053006900200065007300200071007500650020006C00610073002000700069006C006C0061007300200061006C0020007600750065006C006F002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Rotom Ventilador es de tipo Eléctrico y Volador!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 5264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10052006F0074006F006D002000560065006E00740069006C00610064006F00720020006500730020006400650020007400690070006F00200045006C00E900630074007200690063006F0020007900200056006F006C00610064006F0072002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Conoce el movimiento Tajo Aéreo!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 5372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10043006F006E006F0063006500200065006C0020006D006F00760069006D00690065006E0074006F002000540061006A006F0020004100E900720065006F002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Y además tiene control de voz, para poder\nelegir los movimientos a distancia!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 5448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aunque es un poco travieso y, si te descuidas,\nhará que todos tus documentos salgan volando.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 5616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 5812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Cómo te quedas? Si es que no sabes ni por\ndónde te da el aire.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 5824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF004300F3006D006F0020007400650020007100750065006400610073003F00200053006900200065007300200071007500650020006E006F0020007300610062006500730020006E006900200070006F0072000A006400F3006E0064006500200074006500200064006100200065006C00200061006900720065002E00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Y ya por último, Rotom Frío! Así es como se llama\nRotom cuando toma posesión de una nevera.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 5960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Te dejará helad<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 6156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100540065002000640065006A0061007200E1002000680065006C0061006400100003110000FF0101006F0061002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿4",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 6216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Rotom Frío es de tipo Eléctrico y Hielo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 6228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10052006F0074006F006D00200046007200ED006F0020006500730020006400650020007400690070006F00200045006C00E900630074007200690063006F002000790020004800690065006C006F002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Conoce el movimiento Ventisca!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 6320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10043006F006E006F0063006500200065006C0020006D006F00760069006D00690065006E0074006F002000560065006E00740069007300630061002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Su aire frío lo congela todo a su alrededor!\nHmm, creo que no lo estoy vendiendo muy bien...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 6392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por cierto, tengo entendido que Rotom cambia de\nforma por algo de un motor especial.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 6588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿9",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 6768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "De tanto hablar de los Rotom, ni me había\nenterado de que había terminado el combate.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 6780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En Galar existen otras formas como el Rotom\nDron o la Bici Rotom.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 6960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E002000470061006C006100720020006500780069007300740065006E0020006F007400720061007300200066006F0072006D0061007300200063006F006D006F00200065006C00200052006F0074006F006D000A00440072006F006E0020006F0020006C00610020004200690063006900200052006F0074006F006D002E00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Pero, tenga la forma que tenga, es un pillo!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 7100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005000650072006F002C002000740065006E006700610020006C006100200066006F0072006D00610020007100750065002000740065006E00670061002C00200065007300200075006E002000700069006C006C006F002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Puede que los Rotom no sean muy fáciles de\nusar como electrodomésticos.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 7200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero seguro que alguien como tú sabría sacarles\npartido como es debido en combate.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 7352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Por eso te hago obsequio de este catálogo para\ncambiar de forma a los Rotom!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 7528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si atrapas algún Rotom salvaje, pruébalo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 7692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300690020006100740072006100700061007300200061006C006700FA006E00200052006F0074006F006D002000730061006C00760061006A0065002C002000700072007500E900620061006C006F002E00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Según se vayan inventando nuevas máquinas y\nartilugios, supongo que los Rotom también se<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nadaptarán a ellos.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 7784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 115
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Hay un sinfín de posibilidades con los Rotom!\n¡Rotom hasta el infinito!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 8016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿C",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 8172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00430000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Has usado el catálogo para cambiar de forma a\nalgún Rotom?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 8184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF00480061007300200075007300610064006F00200065006C002000630061007400E1006C006F0067006F00200070006100720061002000630061006D006200690061007200200064006500200066006F0072006D006100200061000A0061006C006700FA006E00200052006F0074006F006D003F00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Algún día los Rotom podrán introducirse en\ntodas las máquinas. Imagina la que se puede liar.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 8312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Rototo...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 8508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0052006F0074006F0074006F002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    }
